WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.123
Watch and read: What is the first sound in “cat”?

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.464
The answer is: c. Listen to the first sound of the word.

00:00:08.283 --> 00:00:12.273
Watch and read: What remains when the first sound is removed from “cat”?

00:00:13.117 --> 00:00:17.042
The answer is: at. Take away the first sound, then say what remains.
